WEBVTT

00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:14,800
Would it be a good idea to do blood tests for my hormones in between Dutch tests?

00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:21,240
If so, I am a yearly gyroclogical visit next week and they may be willing to run them.

00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:23,240
Which tests do I ask for?

00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:29,960
Well you ask for a complete hormone panel and certainly if you're going to get blood tests

00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:35,400
anyhow and if your insurance is going to cover it, get everything you can possibly get to

00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:40,400
make sure you're getting a CBC in a complete metabolic panel and ask for tumor marker tests

00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:41,400
to be run.

00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:42,400
You know, ask for everything.

00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:46,040
If your insurance will cover it, that's the best way to go.

